sequenceDiagram
    participant Patient
    participant System
    participant Nomba
    participant Provider
    participant Ops as Operations owner

    System->>System: detect a handoff that can't complete on its own
    note over System: payment lands after hold expires,<br/>or a provider can't fulfil after payment

    alt System can recover automatically
        System->>Nomba: trigger refund
        Nomba-->>Patient: refund received
        System-->>Patient: rebooking prompt
    else Needs a human to act
        System->>Ops: Alert notification
        System-->>Ops: item added to Alerts queue
        Ops->>Provider: follow up if needed
        Ops->>System: resolve Alert
        System-->>Patient: outcome (refund, rebooking, or fix)
    end
